 of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'falco-grice', 'Falco Grice is a supporting character of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'pieck-finger', 'Pieck Finger is a supporting character of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'porco-galliard', 'Porco Galliard is a supporting character of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('attack-on-titan', 'character', 'willy-tybur', 'Willy Tybur is an antagonist of Attack on Titan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Attack_on_Titan_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The Japanese title is the single word BLEACH in capitals, read Burīchi, as in the Japanese name of the Thousand-Year Blood War sequel.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Tite Kubo both wrote and drew the Bleach manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(manga)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Bleach ran in Shueisha''s Weekly Shōnen Jump for fifteen years, from August 2001 until August 2016.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(manga)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The finished manga was collected in 74 tankōbon volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(manga)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The first Bleach anime was made by Pierrot under director Noriyuki Abe and aired on TV Tokyo for 366 episodes, from October 2004 to March 2012.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The sequel series Thousand-Year Blood War began on TV Tokyo on October 11, 2022, with Tomohisa Taguchi taking over as director from Noriyuki Abe.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The anime added four story arcs of its own that are not in the manga: the Bounts, Amagai, the rebelling Zanpakutō and the Reigai copies.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The 2004 to 2012 anime used fifteen opening songs, each running for about two dozen episodes.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_soundtracks', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The first fifteen of the thirty ending songs of the original anime, from Rie fu to Kansha.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_soundtracks', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'The last fifteen ending songs of the original anime, running to the final episode 366.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_soundtracks', 'published'), ('bleach', 'series', 'bleach', 'Four animated Bleach films came out between 2006 and 2010, all directed by Noriyuki Abe with original characters designed by Kubo.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'ichigo-kurosaki', 'Ichigo becomes a Soul Reaper when Rukia Kuchiki hands her powers to him.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bleach_(manga)', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'ichigo-kurosaki', 'Ichigo Kurosaki is a main character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'rukia-kuchiki', 'Rukia Kuchiki is a main character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'orihime-inoue', 'Orihime Inoue is a main character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'uryu-ishida', 'Uryū Ishida is a main character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'yasutora-sado', 'Yasutora Sado is a main character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'kisuke-urahara', 'Kisuke Urahara is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'isshin-kurosaki', 'Isshin Kurosaki is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'kon', 'Kon is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'karin-kurosaki', 'Karin Kurosaki is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'tatsuki-arisawa', 'Tatsuki Arisawa is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'renji-abarai', 'Renji Abarai is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('bleach', 'character', 'yoruichi-shihoin', 'Yoruichi Shihōin is a supporting character of Bleach.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Bleach_characters', 'published'), ('ble