sode 1 to Zanki by Zutomayo in episode 12.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chainsaw_Man_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'denji', 'Denji carries a huge debt that his father left to the yakuza.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'yoru', 'Yoru is a War Devil in a weakened state and counts among the four Horsemen.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'denji', 'Denji is a main character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'pochita', 'Pochita is a main character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'power', 'Power is a main character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'aki-hayakawa', 'Aki Hayakawa is a main character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'makima', 'Makima is a main character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'kobeni-higashiyama', 'Kobeni Higashiyama is a supporting character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'himeno', 'Himeno is a supporting character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'kishibe', 'Kishibe is a supporting 