ps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'fumiko-mifune', 'Fumiko Mifune is a supporting character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('chainsaw-man', 'character', 'yoshida', 'Yoshida is a supporting character of Chainsaw Man.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Chainsaw_Man_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'In Japanese the title is カウボーイビバップ, read Kaubōi Bibappu, a katakana version of Cowboy Bebop.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'Sunrise made the series, with Shinichirō Watanabe leading the team as director.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'The credited creator Hajime Yatate is not one person but a shared pen name for the Sunrise staff.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'The series is a single season of 26 episodes, which the show calls sessions.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'TV Tokyo aired the show first, from 3 April to 26 June 1998, before the full run reached Wowow.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_episodes', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'Satellite channel Wowow showed all of it from 23 October 1998 to 24 April 1999.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_episodes', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'In 2071 a crew of bounty hunters, nicknamed cowboys, chase criminals around the Solar System from a ship called the Bebop.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'Yoko Kanno scored the show in a jazz-heavy style and formed the band Seatbelts to play it.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'theme', 'op-1', 'The opening, Tank!, is a mostly instrumental big band number with a long alto saxophone solo by Masato Honda.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'theme', 'ed-1', 'The first ending theme has vocals by Mai Yamane, and it is one of the few songs in the series sung in Japanese.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Music_of_Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'The film, called Knockin'' on Heaven''s Door in Japan, opened on 1 September 2001, takes place between episodes 22 and 23, and was animated by Bones for Sunrise.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop:_The_Movie', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'When Adult Swim launched on 2 September 2001, Cowboy Bebop was the first anime on its schedule, at midnight Eastern.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cowboy_Bebop', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'series', 'cowboy-bebop', 'Because the film sits between episodes 22 and 23, the story here runs sessions 1 to 22, then the film, then sessions 23 to 26.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_episodes', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'spike-spiegel', 'Spike Spiegel is a main character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'jet-black', 'Jet Black is a main character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'faye-valentine', 'Faye Valentine is a main character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'ed', 'Edward Wong Hau Pepelu Tivrusky IV is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'ein', 'Ein is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'vicious', 'Vicious is an antagonist of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'julia', 'Julia is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'andy-von-de-oniyate', 'Andy von de Oniyate is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'laughing-bull', 'Laughing Bull is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'gren', 'Gren Eckener is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'vincent-volaju', 'Vincent Volaju is an antagonist of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('cowboy-bebop', 'character', 'electra-ovilo', 'Electra Ovilo is a supporting character of Cowboy Bebop.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Cowboy_Bebop_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'The title is written ダンダダン in Japanese, and English editions also render it as Dan Da Dan.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'Yukinobu Tatsu alone writes and draws the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'The manga began on Shueisha''s Shōnen Jump+ platform on April 6, 2021 and is still running.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'The collected edition had reached twenty-five volumes by early September 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'At Manga Barcelona in 2025 the series won the shōnen category, at the festival''s 31st edition.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'Studio Science Saru animated the show, and Fūga Yamashiro directed the first season.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'A third season was announced once season two ended, with a premiere planned for 2027.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_episodes', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'Season one opens with Otonoke by Creepy Nuts and closes with Taidada by Zutomayo.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_episodes', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'Season two opens with Kakumei Dōchū by Aina the End and closes with Doukashiteru by WurtS.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_episodes', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'seiko-ayase', 'Seiko Ayase works as a spirit medium and is the grandmother of Momo.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'series', 'dandadan', 'Viz Media releases the manga in English in North America and hosts its series page.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dandadan', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'momo-ayase', 'Momo Ayase is a main character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'ken-takakura', 'Ken Takakura is a main character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'turbo-granny', 'Turbo Granny is a supporting character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published');
