ng character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'vamola', 'Vamola is a supporting character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'ludris', 'Ludris is a supporting character of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'reiko-kashima', 'Reiko Kashima is an antagonist of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'count-saint-germain', 'Count Saint-Germain is an antagonist of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'unji-zuma', 'Unji Zuma is an antagonist of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('dandadan', 'character', 'kouki-yukishiro', 'Kouki Yukishiro is an antagonist of Dandadan.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Dandadan_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'The Japanese title is written デスノート, read Desu Nōto, which is simply the English name spelled in katakana.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/DEATH_NOTE', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'The manga pairs writer Tsugumi Ohba with artist Takeshi Obata.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Shueisha serialized the story in Weekly Shōnen Jump, starting in December 2003 and wrapping up in May 2006.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'The weekly chapters, 108 in all, were gathered into twelve tankōbon volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_chapters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'The anime ran for 37 episodes on Nippon Television, from the autumn of 2006 to the summer of 2007.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Two bands share the anime''s songs: Nightmare opens and closes the first half, then Maximum the Hormone takes over both slots, and the last episode ends on a short piece by the composer.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note_(2006_TV_series)', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Writer Ohba picked names that sound plausible yet are not found in real life, since so many of the characters are criminals or victims.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'Circulation passed thirty million copies by spring 2015, which ranks the manga among the best sellers of its kind.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'A victim dies only if the writer pictures the face while writing the name, so a name alone is not enough.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'ryuk', 'Ryuk, the Shinigami who loses his notebook, has a weakness for apples.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'l', 'L is a scrawny detective who crouches in his chair and eats sweets without end.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'watari', 'On the surface Watari is Quillsh Wammy, an inventor who founded Wammy''s House, a home for gifted orphans in Winchester, England.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'mello', 'Mello has blond hair, flashy clothes and almost always carries a chocolate bar.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'A prose novel by Nisio Isin, Another Note, came out in 2006 as a spin-off of the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'An American film version premiered only on Netflix in August 2017.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'series', 'death-note', 'In North America Viz Media holds the license for the Death Note books and anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Death_Note', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'light-yagami', 'Light Yagami is a main character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'l', 'L is a main character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'ryuk', 'Ryuk is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'misa-amane', 'Misa Amane is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'soichiro-yagami', 'Soichiro Yagami is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'touta-matsuda', 'Touta Matsuda is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'sayu-yagami', 'Sayu Yagami is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'shuichi-aizawa', 'Shuichi Aizawa is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'kanzo-mogi', 'Kanzo Mogi is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'hideki-ide', 'Hideki Ide is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'hirokazu-ukita', 'Hirokazu Ukita is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'watari', 'Watari is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'rem', 'Rem is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'raye-penber', 'Raye Penber is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'naomi-misora', 'Naomi Misora is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'kiyomi-takada', 'Kiyomi Takada is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'sidoh', 'Sidoh is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'teru-mikami', 'Teru Mikami is an antagonist of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'near', 'Near is a main character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('death-note', 'character', 'mello', 'Mello is a supporting character of Death Note.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Death_Note_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'The Japanese title 鬼滅の刃, Kimetsu no Yaiba, can be roughly translated as Blade of Demon Destruction.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Koyoharu Gotouge both wrote and drew the Demon Slayer manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Shueisha''s Weekly Shonen Jump carried the manga between 15 February 2016 and 18 May 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Shueisha gathered the manga into 23 collected volumes, released between June 2016 and December 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Studio Ufotable produced the TV anime, with Haruo Sotozaki as its director.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'The TV anime launched on April 6, 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Counting only the main TV series, not the films or compilation films, there are 63 episodes in 4 seasons (the usual Wikipedia grouping), aired from 2019 to 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Ahead of the TV broadcast, the first five episodes had a two-week cinema run in Japan starting March 29, 2019, billed as Sibling''s Bond.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_season_1', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'On October 16, 2020, the Mugen Train film opened in Japan, and it went on to be the top-grossing film of 2020 worldwide.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_%E2%80%93_The_Movie:_Mugen_Train', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Season 4, the Hashira Training Arc, opened on May 12, 2024, ran for eight episodes and adapts manga chapters 128-139.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_season_4', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'The Infinity Castle story is being adapted as a film trilogy, and its first film reached Japanese cinemas on July 18, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_%E2%80%93_The_Movie:_Infinity_Castle', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'Two composers, Yuki Kajiura and Go Shiina, share the music of the TV anime.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'series', 'demon-slayer', 'LiSA''s Gurenge, the first opening theme, took the best theme song prize at the 2019 Newtype Anime Awards.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gurenge', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'tanjiro-kamado', 'Tanjiro''s unusually sharp sense of smell helps him track demons and sense how other people feel.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'nezuko-kamado', 'Nezuko does not feed on people; she keeps up her strength by sleeping instead.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'zenitsu-agatsuma', 'Zenitsu knows just one form of Thunder Breathing, yet he has honed it to a remarkable level.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'inosuke-hashibira', 'Inosuke grew up among boars and usually wears the head of his late boar mother as a mask.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'tanjiro-kamado', 'Tanjiro Kamado is a main character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'nezuko-kamado', 'Nezuko Kamado is a main character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'zenitsu-agatsuma', 'Zenitsu Agatsuma is a main character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'inosuke-hashibira', 'Inosuke Hashibira is a main character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'muzan-kibutsuji', 'Muzan Kibutsuji is an antagonist of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'giyu-tomioka', 'Giyu Tomioka is a supporting character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'sakonji-urokodaki', 'Sakonji Urokodaki is a supporting character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'shinobu-kocho', 'Shinobu Kocho is a supporting character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'kanao-tsuyuri', 'Kanao Tsuyuri is a supporting character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'sanemi-shinazugawa', 'Sanemi Shinazugawa is a supporting character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'kagaya-ubuyashiki', 'Kagaya Ubuyashiki is a supporting character of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Demon_Slayer:_Kimetsu_no_Yaiba_characters', 'published'), ('demon-slayer', 'character', 'tamayo', 'Tamayo i