ia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'The opening theme, A Cruel Angel''s Thesis, is sung by Yoko Takahashi, and it took an Animage award for best song in 1996.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'The credits roll to Fly Me to the Moon, a cover with British singer Claire Littley in the lead and several of the leading voice actors.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'No source names story arcs, so this quiz splits the franchise at the TV series tone shift in episode 16, then the two TV finale episodes, the 1997 film and the Rebuild films.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_episodes', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'The End of Evangelion reached Japanese cinemas on July 19, 1997; Gainax and Production I.G made it as a new take on the last two TV episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_End_of_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'Studio Khara reboots the story in four Rebuild of Evangelion films, the first shown on 1 September 2007 and the last on 8 March 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rebuild_of_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'Hideaki Anno began shaping the project in 1993, after a depression that followed his earlier work, with the idea of a hero who stops running away.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'Animage readers voted Evangelion their top Best Loved Series at the Anime Grand Prix in 1996, and again in 1997.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'series', 'evangelion', 'Netflix brought the series to a global audience from June 21, 2019, but outside Japan the closing song Fly Me to the Moon is left out for licensing reasons.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'mari-illustrious-makinami', 'Mari is absent from the 1995 series and first shows up in the Rebuild film released in 2009, the second of four.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'rei-ayanami', 'Books with Rei on the cover sold so well that the press started calling her the Premium Girl.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neon_Genesis_Evangelion', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'shinji-ikari', 'Shinji Ikari is a main character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'rei-ayanami', 'Rei Ayanami is a main character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'asuka-langley-soryu', 'Asuka Langley Soryu is a main character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'misato-katsuragi', 'Misato Katsuragi is a main character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'gendo-ikari', 'Gendo Ikari is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'ritsuko-akagi', 'Ritsuko Akagi is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'ryoji-kaji', 'Ryoji Kaji is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'kaworu-nagisa', 'Kaworu Nagisa is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'toji-suzuhara', 'Toji Suzuhara is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'kozo-fuyutsuki', 'Kozo Fuyutsuki is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'yui-ikari', 'Yui Ikari is a character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('evangelion', 'character', 'mari-illustrious-makinami', 'Mari Illustrious Makinami is a supporting character of Neon Genesis Evangelion.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Neon_Genesis_Evangelion_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End is called 葬送のフリーレン, read Sōsō no Furīren, in Japan, which literally means Frieren at the Funeral.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'The manga has two creators: Kanehito Yamada writes it and Tsukasa Abe draws it.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Frieren began in Shogakukan''s Weekly Shōnen Sunday on 28 April 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Fifteen collected volumes were out by the end of 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'The manga went on an indefinite break in October 2025 so that its two creators could look after their health.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Madhouse made the first anime season, with Keiichirō Saitō directing, and it ran for 28 episodes from September 2023 to March 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Season two aired in early 2026 under a new director, Tomoya Kitagawa, bringing the total to 38 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'A third season was announced right after season two, to cover the Golden Land arc and premiere in October 2027.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Evan Call wrote the music for the anime.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'The anime has used three opening songs: Yoasobi and Yorushika in season one, Mrs. Green Apple in season two.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Milet sang every ending, including the one used only for the four-episode premiere broadcast.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'series', 'frieren', 'Alongside the series came short episodes called Spell That Does OOO, eleven in the first batch.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frieren_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'frieren', 'Frieren is an elf who is already more than a thousand years old.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'fern', 'Fern is a young mage who studies under Frieren after being raised by the priest Heiter.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'qual', 'Qual invented Zoltraak, a spell that mages later studied until it became their standard attack.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'frieren', 'Frieren is a main character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'fern', 'Fern is a main character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'stark', 'Stark is a main character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'sein', 'Sein is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'himmel', 'Himmel is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'character', 'heiter', 'Heiter is a supporting character of Frieren: Beyond Journey''s End.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Frieren_characters', 'published'), ('frieren', 'characte