/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'Haruichi Furudate is the single creator behind Haikyu!!, handling both the story and the drawings.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'Weekly Shōnen Jump magazine carried the manga from February 2012 until July 2020, published by Shueisha.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The collected edition of the manga has 45 volumes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The manga reached television in spring 2014 through Production I.G, whose first season has 25 episodes and wrapped up in September.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'In all, the TV anime has 85 episodes over four seasons, with seven opening songs and seven ending songs.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_episodes', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The fourth season, To The Top, began on January 11, 2020; its second cour slipped to October because of the COVID-19 pandemic and ended on December 19, 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The finale is split into two Haikyu!! Final films: The Dumpster Battle came out on February 16, 2024, and vs. The Little Giant is set for 2027.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The first two seasons each switched songs halfway through, so every season has two openings and two endings.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'Season three kept one pair of songs, while the split-cour fourth season had two pairs.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The TV anime runs four seasons of 25, 25, 10 and 25 episodes, and the story ends in the Haikyu!! Final films.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_episodes', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'shoyo-hinata', 'Hinata''s dream starts when he sees a small ace called the Little Giant lead Karasuno on TV, which is why he joins that school.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'shoyo-hinata', 'Hinata won Best Boy at the fifth Crunchyroll Anime Awards and was also up for Best Protagonist.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'series', 'haikyu', 'The first of four OVA episodes, about the arrival of Lev Haiba, was shown at Jump Festa on November 9, 2014.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Haikyu!!', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'shoyo-hinata', 'Shoyo Hinata is a main character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'tobio-kageyama', 'Tobio Kageyama is a main character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'kei-tsukishima', 'Kei Tsukishima is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'tadashi-yamaguchi', 'Tadashi Yamaguchi is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'daichi-sawamura', 'Daichi Sawamura is a supporting character of Haikyu!!.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Haikyu!!_characters', 'published'), ('haikyu', 'character', 'kos