drew the whole manga himself.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'The manga began in Shueisha''s Weekly Shōnen Jump on 1 January 1987 and moved to the monthly Ultra Jump in 2005.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'By March 2026 the manga filled 139 collected volumes, one of the highest counts of any manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'The first season used two openings, one for each of Parts 1 and 2, and a single ending song for all of its episodes.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_season_1', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Season two switched themes halfway, and also had a special song sung by the characters Oingo and Boingo.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure:_Stardust_Crusaders', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Season three changed its opening three times and used one ending song throughout, plus a special group version of Great Days.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure:_Diamond_Is_Unbreakable', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Season four had two openings and two endings.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure:_Golden_Wind', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Season five had two openings and one ending song, and its last episode brought back Roundabout.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure:_Stone_Ocean', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'The sixth season''s second stage has an opening by Kroi and an ending by Yuki Chiba.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Steel_Ball_Run:_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Stands, the spirit-like fighters that most characters use, are the best-known feature of the series.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'jotaro-kujo', 'Jotaro Kujo is the one character the author modeled on a real person, the actor Clint Eastwood.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'series', 'jojo', 'Before the TV anime, A.P.P.P. made a 13-episode OVA of Stardust Crusaders, released between 1993 and 2002.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'jonathan-joestar', 'Jonathan Joestar is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'dio-brando', 'Dio Brando is an antagonist of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'joseph-joestar', 'Joseph Joestar is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'caesar-zeppeli', 'Caesar Anthonio Zeppeli is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'lisa-lisa', 'Lisa Lisa is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'kars', 'Kars is an antagonist of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'jotaro-kujo', 'Jotaro Kujo is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'avdol', 'Mohammed Avdol is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'kakyoin', 'Noriaki Kakyoin is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'polnareff', 'Jean Pierre Polnareff is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'josuke-higashikata', 'Josuke Higashikata is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'yoshikage-kira', 'Yoshikage Kira is an antagonist of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'rohan-kishibe', 'Rohan Kishibe is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'giorno-giovanna', 'Giorno Giovanna is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'bruno-bucciarati', 'Bruno Bucciarati is a supporting character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'jolyne-cujoh', 'Jolyne Cujoh is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'enrico-pucci', 'Enrico Pucci is an antagonist of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'johnny-joestar', 'Johnny Joestar is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'gyro-zeppeli', 'Gyro Zeppeli is a main character of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jojo', 'character', 'funny-valentine', 'Funny Valentine is an antagonist of JoJo''s Bizarre Adventure.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_JoJo%27s_Bizarre_Adventure_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'The Japanese title 呪術廻戦 (Jujutsu Kaisen) can be read roughly as Sorcery Battle.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Gege Akutami is the sole creator of the manga, handling both the writing and the drawing.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Weekly Shonen Jump carried the manga from 5 March 2018 until 30 September 2024, a run of about six and a half years.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Shueisha serialized the manga in its magazine Weekly Shonen Jump and collected it in the Jump Comics line.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'The collected edition runs to 30 volumes, the last of which reached shelves in Japan on 25 December 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'The TV anime had its broadcast premiere on 3 October 2020, after an early online screening on 19 September 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Counting only the TV series (no films or recap specials), there are 59 episodes over three seasons of 24, 23 and 12.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'MAPPA is the animation studio behind all three TV seasons broadcast so far.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Sunghoo Park directed season 1, and Shota Goshozono took over as series director from season 2.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_episodes', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'In 2026 the third season, subtitled The Culling Game: Part 1, began airing on 9 January and ran for 12 episodes; a fourth season, Part 2, was announced as soon as it ended.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_season_3', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'The prequel Jujutsu Kaisen 0 began life as a four-chapter manga called Tokyo Metropolitan Curse Technical School, printed in Jump Giga in 2017.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_0', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'The film Jujutsu Kaisen 0 opened in Japanese cinemas on 24 December 2021 and was that year''s top earner at the Japanese box office.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_0_(film)', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'In June 2021 the manga paused for the author''s health, and serialization resumed on 2 August 2021.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Volume 30, out on 25 December 2024, adds 16 new pages of four epilogues starring Panda, Nobara Kugisaki, Uraume and Yuko Ozawa.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'After the main story ended, Akutami and artist Yuji Iwasaki ran a short spin-off, Jujutsu Kaisen Modulo, in Weekly Shonen Jump from 8 September 2025 to 9 March 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'The manga''s worldwide circulation, digital editions included, has passed 150 million copies.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'At the fifth Crunchyroll Anime Awards the series took the Anime of the Year prize, and its second season repeated the feat at the eighth ceremony.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'From episode 3 of season 1, short slice-of-life clips called Juju Sanpo play after the credits, following the cast in their daily lives.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_season_1', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'series', 'jujutsu-kaisen', 'Crunchyroll rolled out dubs in five languages (German, French, Portuguese, Spanish and English) on 20 November 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'yuji-itadori', 'Yuji''s execution is postponed on one condition: he must first swallow every one of Ryomen Sukuna''s twenty fingers.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'satoru-gojo', 'Satoru Gojo, the teacher who takes Yuji in, holds the title of strongest sorcerer of the present day.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jujutsu_Kaisen', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'kinji-hakari', 'Kinji Hakari''s Domain Expansion, Idle Death Gamble, hits its jackpot at odds of 1 in 239, and the jackpot lasts exactly 4 minutes 11 seconds, during which his cursed energy never runs out.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'aoi-todo', 'Aoi Todo''s habit of asking people which kind of woman they like was picked up from his mentor, the Special Grade sorcerer Yuki Tsukumo.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'yuji-itadori', 'Yuji Itadori is a main character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'satoru-gojo', 'Satoru Gojo is a main character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'megumi-fushiguro', 'Megumi Fushiguro is a main character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'nobara-kugisaki', 'Nobara Kugisaki is a main character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'ryomen-sukuna', 'Ryomen Sukuna is an antagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'kento-nanami', 'Kento Nanami is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'maki-zenin', 'Maki Zen''in is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'toge-inumaki', 'Toge Inumaki is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'panda', 'Panda is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'aoi-todo', 'Aoi Todo is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'mahito', 'Mahito is an antagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'suguru-geto', 'Suguru Geto is an antagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'yuta-okkotsu', 'Yuta Okkotsu is a main character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'toji-fushiguro', 'Toji Fushiguro is an antagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'choso', 'Choso is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'kenjaku', 'Kenjaku is an antagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'jogo', 'Jogo is an antagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'hanami', 'Hanami is an antagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'kinji-hakari', 'Kinji Hakari is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'hajime-kashimo', 'Hajime Kashimo is an antagonist of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'hiromi-higuruma', 'Hiromi Higuruma is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'yuki-tsukumo', 'Yuki Tsukumo is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'rika-orimoto', 'Rika Orimoto is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'junpei-yoshino', 'Junpei Yoshino is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'riko-amanai', 'Riko Amanai is a character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'mai-zenin', 'Mai Zen''in is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'kasumi-miwa', 'Kasumi Miwa is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'utahime-iori', 'Utahime Iori is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'shoko-ieiri', 'Shoko Ieiri is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('jujutsu-kaisen', 'character', 'kiyotaka-ijichi', 'Kiyotaka Ijichi is a supporting character of Jujutsu Kaisen.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Jujutsu_Kaisen_characters', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'The series is written in katakana as カグラバチ, the same word the Weekly Shonen Jump page uses for its title.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'Takeru Hokazono both writes and draws the manga, and the official Jump page spells his name 外薗 健.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'Kagurabachi started in Shueisha''s Weekly Shōnen Jump in September 2023, which the official page lists as issue 42 of that year.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'The collected editions reached 12 volumes, with the first released on February 2, 2024 and the twelfth on September 4, 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'As of October 2026 the manga was past the 4.5 million mark in circulation, up from about a million two years earlier.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'In 2024 it took the tenth Next Manga Award for print manga, and in 2026 the Japan Expo Awards gave it the Daruma for best action manga.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published');
insert into _k1_trivia values ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'Viz Media announced a print edition in March 2024 and published volume 1 on November 5, 2024; Shueisha''s Manga Plus also carries the series in English.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'The twelve collected volumes run from chapter 1 to chapter 113, so chapter 114 is the first one still waiting for its volume.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'The tale unfolds in today''s Japan, 18 years after the Seitei War, a conflict in which hidden sorcery finally came into the open.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'Its first chapter was the most viewed worldwide in its first week on Manga Plus, and the platform logged more than 99 million views of the series by April 2024.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'series', 'kagurabachi', 'Kamunabi is the state-run sorcerer agency set up in the Seitei War years to deal with dangers facing all of Japan.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'chihiro-rokuhira', 'Chihiro carries Enten, a secret seventh Enchanted Blade made by his father, which gives him stronger physical ability and lets him absorb energy.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'hakuri-sazanami', 'Hakuri can use both his clan''s Isou technique and the Storehouse, a subspace for keeping objects and people, which only one other clan member ever managed.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'seiichi-samura', 'Samura is a disciple of Itsuo Shirakai (白廻逸夫), the swordsman who created the Iai White Purity Style around the pursuit of speed.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'chihiro-rokuhira', 'Chihiro Rokuhira is a main character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'togo-shiba', 'Togo Shiba is a main character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'char-kyonagi', 'Char Kyonagi is a supporting character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'soshiro-azami', 'Soshiro Azami is a supporting character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'genichi-sojo', 'Genichi Sojo is an antagonist of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'kunishige-rokuhira', 'Kunishige Rokuhira is a supporting character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'hakuri-sazanami', 'Hakuri Sazanami is a main character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'hiyuki-kagari', 'Hiyuki Kagari is a supporting character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'yura', 'Yura is an antagonist of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'iori-samura', 'Iori Samura is a supporting character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'seiichi-samura', 'Seiichi Samura is a supporting character of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kagurabachi', 'character', 'akemura-soga', 'Akemura Soga is an antagonist of Kagurabachi.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kagurabachi', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Kaiju No. 8 is called Kaijū Hachigō in Japan, and its English alternate title is Monster #8.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Naoya Matsumoto is both writer and artist of the manga, which ran on Shueisha''s Shōnen Jump+ from July 3, 2020 until July 18, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_chapters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'The story closed after 129 chapters collected in 16 volumes, with the final book reaching Japanese shops on September 4, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_chapters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Production I.G animated the first season, with Studio Khara handling the kaiju designs; the 12 episodes ran between April 13 and June 29, 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_episodes', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Season two followed in July 2025 and brought the anime to 23 episodes in total; its last episode aired on September 27, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_episodes', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'The first season opens with Abyss by Yungblud and closes each episode with Nobody by OneRepublic.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_episodes', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'For season two the opening is You Can''t Run From Yourself by Aurora, and OneRepublic returns with Beautiful Colors as the ending.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_episodes', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'No source names story arcs, so this quiz uses the two anime seasons and then the part of the manga the anime has not covered yet.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_episodes', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Officers fight in powered suits built from kaiju remains, and each suit shows a combat power percentage that tops out at 100.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Matsumoto drew on Japanese tokusatsu shows, above all the Ultraman series, and used his own struggles as a manga artist for Kafka''s backstory.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'The manga took the 2021 Next Manga Award for web manga and was shortlisted for an Eisner Award the year after.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'By September 2026 more than 20 million copies of the manga were in circulation.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'series', 'kaiju-no-8', 'Besides the main manga there is a light novel by Keiji Andō from November 2022 and two spin-off manga that both began in 2024, B-Side and Relax.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kaiju_No._8', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'kikoru-shinomiya', 'Kikoru is a prodigy: no recruit before her has been logged with a higher unleashed combat power score.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'kafka-hibino', 'Kafka Hibino is a main character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'reno-ichikawa', 'Reno Ichikawa is a main character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'kikoru-shinomiya', 'Kikoru Shinomiya is a main character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'mina-ashiro', 'Mina Ashiro is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'soshiro-hoshina', 'Soshiro Hoshina is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'gen-narumi', 'Gen Narumi is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'isao-shinomiya', 'Isao Shinomiya is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'iharu-furuhashi', 'Iharu Furuhashi is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'haruichi-izumo', 'Haruichi Izumo is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'keiji-itami', 'Keiji Itami is a supporting character of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'kaiju-no-9', 'Kaiju No. 9 is an antagonist of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('kaiju-no-8', 'character', 'kaiju-no-10', 'Kaiju No. 10 is an antagonist of Kaiju No. 8.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Kaiju_No._8_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'In Japan the series is titled 僕のヒーローアカデミア, read Boku no Hīrō Akademia.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Kōhei Horikoshi wrote and drew every chapter of the manga himself.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'The manga ran for a decade, from July 2014 until its finale in August 2024.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Kenji Nagasaki directed the early seasons and then served as chief director for the rest.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia_(TV_series)', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'A bonus television special that adapts chapter 431 premiered on 2 May 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'The manga has won both a Sugoi Japan Award and a Harvey Award.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'During the Meta Liberation Army stretch, the title of the series temporarily changes to My Villain Academia.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia_season_5', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Roughly four in five people in this world have a superpower called a Quirk.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'Four animated films have been released, starting with Two Heroes and ending with You''re Next.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'One of the spin-off manga is Vigilantes, which ran between 2016 and 2022.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'izuku-midoriya', 'Izuku starts the story as a boy with no Quirk at all, yet still dreams of becoming a hero.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'series', 'my-hero-academia', 'A live-action film from Legendary Entertainment has been announced and is still in development.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/My_Hero_Academia', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'izuku-midoriya', 'Izuku Midoriya is a main character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'katsuki-bakugo', 'Katsuki Bakugo is a main character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'ochaco-uraraka', 'Ochaco Uraraka is a main character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'shoto-todoroki', 'Shoto Todoroki is a main character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'tenya-ida', 'Tenya Ida is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'eijiro-kirishima', 'Eijiro Kirishima is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'momo-yaoyorozu', 'Momo Yaoyorozu is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'tsuyu-asui', 'Tsuyu Asui is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'denki-kaminari', 'Denki Kaminari is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'fumikage-tokoyami', 'Fumikage Tokoyami is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'mina-ashido', 'Mina Ashido is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'kyoka-jiro', 'Kyoka Jiro is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'minoru-mineta', 'Minoru Mineta is a supporting character of My Hero Academia.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_My_Hero_Academia_characters', 'published'), ('my-hero-academia', 'character', 'all-might', 'All M