ber 1999 to mid November 2014.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naruto', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Tetsuya Nishio designed the characters for the anime because Kishimoto himself asked for him.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Naruto', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Shippuden opened with Hero''s Come Back!! by nobodyknows+, which accompanied the first thirty episodes.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/NARUTO_-%E3%83%8A%E3%83%AB%E3%83%88-_%E7%96%BE%E9%A2%A8%E4%BC%9D', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'Singer Akeboshi performed two endings of the first series: Wind at the start and Yellow moon much later.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/NARUTO_-%E3%83%8A%E3%83%AB%E3%83%88-_(%E3%82%A2%E3%83%8B%E3%83%A1)', 'published'), ('naruto', 'series', 'naruto', 'The Boruto manga began in Weekly Shonen Jump in May 2016 and switched to the monthly V Jump in July 2019.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boruto', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'naruto-uzumaki', 'Naruto Uzumaki is a main character of Naruto.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'sasuke-uchiha', 'Sasuke Uchiha is a main character of Naruto.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'sakura-haruno', 'Sakura Haruno is a main character of Naruto.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'kakashi-hatake', 'Kakashi Hatake is a main character of Naruto.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'iruka-umino', 'Iruka Umino is a supporting character of Naruto.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_character