 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'kaguya-otsutsuki', 'Kaguya Otsutsuki is an antagonist of Naruto.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'boruto-uzumaki', 'Boruto Uzumaki is a main character of Naruto.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('naruto', 'character', 'sarada-uchiha', 'Sarada Uchiha is a main character of Naruto.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Naruto_characters', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The Korean title is 전지적 독자 시점, and the English name Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint is also shortened to Omniscient Reader.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The Chinese Wikipedia infobox gives the Korean title in Latin letters as Jeonjijeok Dokja Sijeom.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The story comes from singNsong''s web novel; the Webtoon page credits UMI and Sleepy-C alongside it, with Sleepy-C as the webtoon artist.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The original web novel started on the Munpia platform on January 6, 2018, and its main story was finished on February 2, 2020.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The main web novel runs for 551 chapters, a count that leaves out the side stories added later.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%EC%A0%84%EC%A7%80%EC%A0%81_%EB%8F%85%EC%9E%90_%EC%8B%9C%EC%A0%90', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The webtoon adaptation went live on Naver Webtoon on May 26, 2020, opening with a prologue episode.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'English readers got the webtoon on August 18, 2020, when the prologue and the first two episodes were posted on the same day.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'Season 1 ended on the Naver Webtoon with episode 311 on June 9, 2026, labeled as the season finale, and the series is now on a break.', 'history', 'official', 'https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=747269', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'The Yen Press imprint IZE Press announced in June 2023 that it holds English rights to both the comic and the novel; the first English novel volume came out on July 22, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'In Korea the comic is collected by A.Tempo Media: volumes 1 and 2 appeared together on December 22, 2020, and 18 had been released by March 2026.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'A live-action film directed by Kim Byung-woo opened in South Korean cinemas on July 23, 2025.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader:_The_Prophecy', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'series', 'omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'We split the webtoon into five blocks of ten of Naver''s own Ep. chapters, named after the first and last chapter titles; the episode numbers are the ones printed in the Naver titles.', 'history', 'official', 'https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=747269', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'kim-dokja', 'Dokja has been the sole reader of the web novel Three Ways to Survive in a Ruined World for 13 years, and it has 3,149 chapters.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Omniscient_Reader%27s_Viewpoint', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'kim-dokja', 'Kim Dokja is a main character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'yoo-joonghyuk', 'Yoo Joonghyuk is a main character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'han-sooyoung', 'Han Sooyoung is a main character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'yoo-sangah', 'Yoo Sangah is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'jung-heewon', 'Jung Heewon is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'lee-hyunsung', 'Lee Hyunsung is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'lee-gilyoung', 'Lee Gilyoung is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'lee-jihye', 'Lee Jihye is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'gong-pildu', 'Gong Pildu is an antagonist of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'han-myungoh', 'Han Myungoh is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'bihyung', 'Bihyung is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('omniscient-readers-viewpoint', 'character', 'shin-yoosung', 'Shin Yoosung is a supporting character of Omniscient Reader''s Viewpoint.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%A8%E7%9F%A5%E8%AE%80%E8%80%85%E8%A6%96%E8%A7%92', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'In Japan the title is spelled in katakana as ワンピース, read Wan Pīsu, the same two words as the English name.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/ONE_PIECE', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Eiichiro Oda is the one person behind both the writing and the drawing of the One Piece manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Shueisha has run the manga in its weekly magazine Weekly Shōnen Jump since the summer of 1997, starting on 22 July.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'By the start of July 2026 Shueisha had put out 115 collected volumes of the manga.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'The first fifteen openings begin with We Are! by Hiroshi Kitadani and include pop acts such as Folder 5, TVXQ and Namie Amuro.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Openings 16 to 29 run from Hands Up! to Luminous, and include groups like AAA, V6 and Sekai no Owari plus a return of Hiroshi Kitadani.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'The first twelve ending songs open with Memories by Maki Otsuki and finish with Tsuki to Taiyō by Shela.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Endings 13 to 23 lead from Dreamship to Sono Mirai, the ending that began with the Elbaph arc in 2026.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Printed circulation worldwide had grown past six hundred million copies by the spring of 2026, the highest total of any manga.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Guinness World Records recognized Oda in 2015 and again in 2022 for the most copies published of one comic series by a single author.', 'achievements', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'monkey-d-luffy', 'Luffy swallowed the Gum-Gum Fruit by mistake, which turned his body into rubber.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Kohei Tanaka and Shiro Hamaguchi wrote the music for the anime.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'The early English dub by 4Kids trimmed the first 143 episodes to 104 through edits for content and running time.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'We Are! served as the opening for the first 47 episodes and made a comeback for episode 1000.', 'music', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Viz Media holds the English license for North America and the United Kingdom, while Madman Entertainment covers Australia.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Netflix put out a live-action One Piece television series in 2023.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'From April 2026 the anime moved away from its year-round weekly schedule to two split cours each year.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_episodes', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'The anime began adapting the Elbaph arc on 5 April 2026, after a short break at the start of that year.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece_(1999_TV_series)', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'gol-d-roger', 'Luffy''s journey aims at the treasure left behind by the late King of the Pirates, which is named the One Piece.', 'fun', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Besides Luffy the Straw Hat crew holds a swordsman, a navigator, a marksman, a cook, a doctor, an archaeologist, a shipwright, a musician and a helmsman.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'The Wano Country season is the longest of the 22 home media seasons, with 197 episodes.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_episodes', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'Season 5 of the home media release carries the title TV Original, since its 13 episodes are new stories made for the anime.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_episodes', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'series', 'one-piece', 'A second anime adaptation, made by Wit Studio, is planned for 2027.', 'history', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/One_Piece', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'monkey-d-luffy', 'Monkey D. Luffy is a main character of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'roronoa-zoro', 'Roronoa Zoro is a main character of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'shanks', 'Shanks is a supporting character of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikidata', 'https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2321523', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'gol-d-roger', 'Gol D. Roger is a character of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikidata', 'https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2619344', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'nami', 'Nami is a main character of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'buggy', 'Buggy is an antagonist of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'usopp', 'Usopp is a main character of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'sanji', 'Sanji is a main character of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'dracule-mihawk', 'Dracule Mihawk is a supporting character of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'smoker', 'Smoker is an antagonist of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikidata', 'https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2727057', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'monkey-d-dragon', 'Monkey D. Dragon is a supporting character of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'nefertari-vivi', 'Nefertari Vivi is a supporting character of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'tony-tony-chopper', 'Tony Tony Chopper is a main character of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'crocodile', 'Crocodile is an antagonist of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikidata', 'https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2726975', 'published'), ('one-piece', 'character', 'portgas-d-ace', 'Portgas D. Ace is a supporting character of One Piece.', 'members', 'wikipedia', 'https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_One_Piece_characters', 'published'), ('one-piece